function tomSound(kind){if(typeof window==='undefined')return;try{let a=tomSound.audio;if(!a){let Audio=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext;if(!Audio)return;a=tomSound.audio=new Audio();}if(a.state!=='running')return;let o=a.createOscillator(),g=a.createGain(),at=a.currentTime;o.type='triangle';o.frequency.setValueAtTime(kind==='slam'?75:125,at);o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(30,at+.16);g.gain.setValueAtTime(.05,at);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,at+.2);o.connect(g);g.connect(a.destination);o.start();o.stop(at+.21);}catch{}}
function tomWakeSound(){tomSound('punch');try{tomSound.audio?.resume();}catch{}}
function tomSegment(e,a,b){let x=b.x-a.x,y=b.y-a.y,n=x*x+y*y,u=n?clamp(((e.x-a.x)*x+(e.y-a.y)*y)/n,0,1):0;return Math.hypot(e.x-a.x-x*u,e.y-a.y-y*u);}
function tomImpact(e,damage,heavy=false,source='weapon'){if(!e||e.hp<=0)return;let a=Math.atan2(e.y-p.y,e.x-p.x),push=heavy&&!tomAnchored(e);damageEnemy(e,damage,push?Math.cos(a)*3.5*(tier>=4?1.3:1):0,push?Math.sin(a)*3.5*(tier>=4?1.3:1):0,false,source);if(heavy&&tomSmall(e)&&tier>=3)e.stunUntil=Math.max(e.stunUntil||0,time+.28);pop(e.x,e.y,'#edc283',heavy?12:6);}
function tomLaunch(e,angle,collision=0){if(!tomSmall(e)||e.hp<=0)return;tom.launches=tom.launches.filter(q=>q.enemy!==e);tom.launches.push({enemy:e,x:e.x,y:e.y,vx:Math.cos(angle)*310,vy:Math.sin(angle)*310,t:0,life:.5,collision,hit:new Set([e.id])});if(tom.launches.length>24)tom.launches.shift();e.kx=e.ky=0;e.stunUntil=Math.max(e.stunUntil||0,time+.5);}
function tomAttack(){if(!isTom()||p.action||tom.barge||tom.slam>0)return false;let e=nearest(p,new Set(),120);if(!e||dist(p,e)>66+e.r)return false;let n=++tom.hits,upper=tier>=5&&n%5===0,double=n%3===0,base=CHARACTERS.tom.damage*(tier>=1?1.15:1)*(tom.rebound?1.6:1);tom.rebound=false;tom.paw=1-tom.paw;tom.punch=.25;tom.aim=Math.atan2(e.y-p.y,e.x-p.x);tom.upper=upper;tom.double=double&&!upper;
 // One primary hit on overlaps: the uppercut takes precedence over the third-hit smash.
 tomImpact(e,base*(upper?2:double?1.35:1),upper||double);if(upper)tomLaunch(e,tom.aim,base*.6);else if(double&&tier>=2){radialEffect(e.x,e.y,55,'#edc283');for(let other of enemies.slice())if(other!==e&&other.hp>0&&dist(e,other)<55+other.r)tomImpact(other,base*.65,true);}tomSound(upper||double?'slam':'punch');shake=upper?5:double?3:1.5;return true;}
function tomWave(x,y,r,damage,wait=0,launch=false,source='special'){tom.waves.push({x,y,r,damage,wait,age:0,duration:.42,hit:new Set(),launch,source});if(tom.waves.length>8)tom.waves.shift();}
function tomSpecial(){if(state!=='playing'||p.action||tom.barge||tom.slam>0||p.chargeCD>0)return;tom.slam=.32;p.chargeCD=specialCooldown();let radius=110*(S(2)?1.25:1),damage=38*(S(4)?1.3:1),count=S(5)?3:S(1)?2:1;for(let n=0;n<count;n++)tomWave(p.x,p.y,radius*(n===1?.8:n===2?1.15:1),damage*(n===1?.6:n===2?1.15:1),.16+n*.3,S(5)&&n===2);pop(p.x,p.y,'#cfb58a',20);tomSound('slam');shake=6;}
function tomDodge(){if(state!=='playing'||p.action||tom.barge||tom.slam>0||p.dodgeCD>0)return;let n=Math.hypot(stick.x,stick.y),dir=n>.1?{x:stick.x/n,y:stick.y/n}:{...p.dir};tom.barge={t:0,dir,hit:new Set()};p.dodgeCD=dodgeCooldown();tomSound('punch');pop(p.x,p.y,'#c5b38c',10);}
function tomAvoidHit(){return isTom()&&!!tom.barge&&tom.barge.t<=.25;}
function tomMotion(dt){if(!isTom())return false;if(tom.slam>0){p.vx=p.vy=0;return true;}let d=tom.barge;if(!d)return false;let from={x:p.x,y:p.y};d.t+=dt;let speed=440*(D(1)?1.2:1)*(1-Math.min(1,d.t/.28)*.5),q=walkable(p.x+d.dir.x*speed*dt,p.y+d.dir.y*speed*dt,p.r);p.x=q.x;p.y=q.y;p.dir={...d.dir};p.vx=p.vy=0;p.walk+=dt*6;for(let e of enemies.slice())if(e.hp>0&&!d.hit.has(e.id)&&tomSegment(e,from,p)<e.r+p.r+6){d.hit.add(e.id);if(D(2))tomImpact(e,D(5)?32:18,false,'dodge');if(!tomAnchored(e)){e.kx+=d.dir.x*180;e.ky+=d.dir.y*180;}if(D(4))tom.rebound=true;if(D(5))tomLaunch(e,Math.atan2(d.dir.y,d.dir.x));pop(e.x,e.y,'#e6c38f',8);}tom.dust+=dt;if(tom.dust>.05){tom.dust=0;pop(p.x-d.dir.x*15,p.y-d.dir.y*15,'#c5b38c',3);}if(d.t>=.28){tom.barge=null;if(D(5)){tomWave(p.x,p.y,85,26,0,false,'dodge');shake=4;}}return true;}
function updateTom(dt){if(!isTom())return;tom.punch=Math.max(0,tom.punch-dt);tom.slam=Math.max(0,tom.slam-dt);
 for(let w of tom.waves){if(w.wait>0){w.wait-=dt;if(w.wait>0)continue;tomSound('slam');pop(w.x,w.y,'#d8bc8a',10);}w.age+=dt;let r=w.r*Math.min(1,w.age/w.duration);for(let e of enemies.slice())if(e.hp>0&&!w.hit.has(e.id)&&dist(w,e)<r+e.r){w.hit.add(e.id);tomImpact(e,w.damage,false,w.source);if(w.source==='special'){if(tomSmall(e))e.stunUntil=Math.max(e.stunUntil||0,time+(S(4)?.4:.18));if(S(3))e.slowUntil=Math.max(e.slowUntil||0,time+(tomAnchored(e)?.5:2));if(w.launch)tomLaunch(e,Math.atan2(e.y-w.y,e.x-w.x));}}}tom.waves=tom.waves.filter(w=>w.wait>0||w.age<w.duration+.12);
 for(let q of tom.launches){let e=q.enemy;if(e.hp<=0||!enemies.includes(e)){q.t=q.life;continue;}let from={x:q.x,y:q.y};q.t+=dt;let at=walkable(q.x+q.vx*dt,q.y+q.vy*dt,e.r);q.x=e.x=at.x;q.y=e.y=at.y;e.kx=e.ky=0;q.vx*=Math.exp(-dt*2);q.vy*=Math.exp(-dt*2);if(q.collision)for(let other of enemies.slice())if(other.hp>0&&!q.hit.has(other.id)&&tomSegment(other,from,e)<e.r+other.r){q.hit.add(other.id);damageEnemy(other,q.collision,0,0,false,'weapon');pop(other.x,other.y,'#f5ce86',7);}}tom.launches=tom.launches.filter(q=>q.t<q.life&&q.enemy.hp>0);
}
function drawTomEnemy(e){let q=isTom()&&tom.launches.find(q=>q.enemy.id===e.id);ctx.save();if(q){ellipse(e.x,e.y+e.r,e.r,.25*e.r,'#16372955');ctx.translate(0,-Math.sin(q.t/q.life*Math.PI)*24);}drawEnemy(e);ctx.restore();}
