const havText=['Normal bolt and split-spark damage +15%.','Fire 20% faster.','Every fourth main impact releases 5 sparks instead of 3; spark damage 3 → 4.5.','Every third normal attack fires a second full-power bolt.','Main bolts ricochet to 2 more enemies, never revisiting; tiny sparks do not split or ricochet.'];
